{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的音乐细节对应和感受层次明显不如X，尤其缺少X那种随乐句推进、逐步显现的细腻变化。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y更像一个普通观众能够直接读懂的人的故事：每段的行为、心理原因和情绪转折交代得比较完整，从离开后的失落、怀念与犹疑，到决定继续生活，前后形成了清楚的因果链。X的优势是重点突出、音乐感受细腻，而且到时出现的提示能贴合音乐进程，但感受词密度较高，部分地方需要观众自己把音乐描述、心理状态和人物动机拼起来。综合实际观看体验，我更愿意选Y，但希望保留X的音乐细节和即时呈现方式。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7628d274-b76d-49b0-ac25-713cbedb0fb7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T220622120526Z", "elapsed_seconds": 48.813, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:07:10.957287+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4640bd528dfc7190623802d732b03870a09f3535b674656238f65bbfa4f7182c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt